hindsight/codex-creds/

# Generated by cmd/assetbuild during the image build; never commit the bundles.
internal/web/static/dist/

# Phase 1 (docs/rewrite-plan.md): web/'s Vite build output. Source lives in web/src, this is produced by
# `npm run build` and embedded via the existing //go:embed static in internal/web/static_http.go.
internal/web/static/next/

# Secrets never belong in a commit: the template is `.env.example`, the real file is local.
**/.env
!**/.env.example
*.bak-*

# Build output and installers: produced by the image build or by Gradle, never committed.
# `go test -cpuprofile/-memprofile` also leaves its linked test binary behind.
*.test
android/app/build/
*.apk
internal/web/static/dist/

# Python bytecode from the dev tools.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
